{"kind":"assert","text":"FH-1 gains one check: the shared-helper check runs in the pre-commit\nhook.\n\nNF-5 gate attempt 1 stopped at the `helpers` step after 1.9 s (END\n`72a4b414`). `browser-custody.ts` defines `natural`, which\n`packages/bytes/src/values.ts` owns. That is the sixth gate attempt in\nthree days that a check of under two seconds stopped.\n\nIn the planner's gate of 15:06 today, `helpers` took 0.8 s. So the\nhook of request `c8b2f4f6` also runs\n`node scripts/check-shared-helpers.mjs` and refuses the commit when it\nfails. One more scratch witness covers it. The gate keeps the step.\n\nThe rule for the hook: a check goes in when it reads only the\ncheckout and takes under two seconds. `citations` took 7.5 s and\nstays out.\n\nThis changes no order. The NF-5 repair and its second gate attempt\ncome first.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}